847 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 333 0 R
/E (This age band also requires increasing attention to adolescent heterogeneity. Young people with different neurodevelopmental profiles, prior mental health difficulties, trauma histories, social isolation, or limited offline support may interact with AI in different ways and may be more exposed to reliance on social or relational systems. Governance therefore needs both universal safeguards for all adolescents and more targeted protections for higher-risk contexts and users.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
